  "user": "I'm CUS-0004. Transaction TX-0401, 240.00 EUR: the goods never arrived. Which reason code applies?",
  "answer": "The reason code that matches is **goods_not_received**. You paid for goods that never arrived, so that's the code to use.\n\n- **Transaction:** TX-0401, EUR 240.00, TechMart Online, 20 July 2026, settled\n- **Window:** 90 days from the transaction date, so it closes on 18 October 2026.\n\nI also noticed TX-0402: another EUR 240.00 charge to TechMart Online on 14 July 2026. If that was a second charge for the same order, a separate dispute under **duplicate_charge** (60-day window, closing 12 September 2026) may apply to it. Let me know if you want me to check that one.\n\nI haven't opened anything yet. If you'd like me to check eligibility and file the dispute for TX-0401 under goods_not_received, confirm and I'll proceed.",
